        "name": "dsh-isolation-gate",
        "title": {
          "en": "Access Gate",
          "zh": "门禁 · 目录访问管制"
        },
        "description": {
          "en": "Access gate for directories: adds a '门禁' entry right below 'Skills' in the app-level nav row (official sidebar.panellist seat, order 6), diffs the managed roster (D:\\.agents\\门禁-名单.txt — one managed object per line: a top-level directory name under D:\\ or any absolute path) against the disk, toggles each object between three levels (deny / read / full), and persists the state to D:\\.agents\\门禁-授权.json for agents and tools to read. Paths match by longest path-segment prefix; a missing or corrupt roster makes the gate deny everything (fail-closed). Roster edits only land after the owner presses the button in the panel, and the file is backed up first.",
          "zh": "门禁 · 目录访问管制：在导航排「技能」正下方加一个「门禁」入口（官方 sidebar.panellist 槽位，order 6），把受管名单（D:\\.agents\\门禁-名单.txt —— 一行一个受管对象，D 根一级目录【名字】或【任意绝对路径】）与磁盘比对并标出差异，逐个受管对象切换三级授权（禁 / 只读 / 可读写删），状态持久化到 D:\\.agents\\门禁-授权.json 供 agent / 工具侧读取；路径按「路径段最长前缀」命中，名单读不到时一律拒绝；名单增删只在界面里给出差异、由户主点击后落盘（改前先备份到回收站）。"
        },
